md prints a fourth entry, "4  ", for a document of three lines.

Same cause as lines-counts-a-document-that-ends-with-a-newline: the
empty element components(separatedBy:) leaves after the final
newline is listed as a line of its own. Nothing follows the last
newline, so nothing should be numbered after gamma.

The phantom line also widens the padding once the real count reaches
9, because the width comes from the inflated count.
